{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And the name of the Israelite man, etc.</b> Where Scripture traces the lineage of the righteous, it traces the lineage of the wicked to their disgrace (Tanchuma)." "<b>A prince of a father's house among the Simeonites.</b> Of one of the five father's houses that the tribe of Simeon had. Another interpretation — to declare the praise of Phinehas: even though this man was a prince, he did not hold himself back from being zealous for the desecration of the Name. Therefore Scripture informed you who the slain man was."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:45.819119336Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}